CODE ADAPTATION
===============

@vibe-cafe/vibe-usage
---------------------

Project:  @vibe-cafe/vibe-usage
Source:   https://github.com/vibe-cafe/vibe-usage
License:  MIT, as declared by the upstream package and README
Audited snapshot: a4967515b770264d61c53cab1a29752bfb31bce6

The initial implementations and related tests/fixtures for parts of the parser
layer were adapted from this project. The affected area includes shared parser
aggregation patterns and source readers for Kimi Code, Claude Code, Codex,
OpenCode, Gemini CLI, Antigravity, GitHub Copilot CLI, Cursor, and Roo Code,
as well as later Pi Coding Agent, ZCode, and WorkBuddy compatibility work,
including supporting SQLite utilities where applicable.

The adapted code has since been substantially modified for this project,
including exclusive cache-write/cache-read/reasoning counters, canonical model
metadata, reasoning effort and Agent version dimensions, bounded activity-hour
slices, installation-salted session identifiers, source-level failure isolation,
and the kimi.builders v2 sync protocol.


CodexBar provider integrations
------------------------------

Project:    CodexBar
Source:     https://github.com/steipete/CodexBar
License:    MIT
Copyright:  Copyright (c) 2026 Peter Steinberger
Audited snapshot: e5528d452d4f82cbd7e327246b9044e9c51d64e1

Provider-specific endpoint knowledge, request shapes, response mapping, local
credential discovery, and related test cases in the subscription-limit layer
were adapted or reimplemented from CodexBar's provider integrations. This
particularly applies to Codex, Claude, Cursor, GitHub Copilot, OpenCode, Qoder,
Warp, Gemini, Antigravity, JetBrains AI, and Windsurf where the corresponding
source exists upstream.

The implementation here translates those provider facts into JavaScript and a
different normalized quota contract, then adds a provider allowlist, loopback-
only credential boundary, macOS Keychain handling, redacted browser responses,
isolated refresh failures, and the Kimi Builders setup UI. No CodexBar binary is
distributed in this package.


