PROJECT-ORIGINAL SCOPE
======================

The local web dashboard and poster implementation, local HTTP capability-token
security boundary, provider-agnostic quota orchestration and settings UI,
standard-API price engine, device metadata, community authorization and sync
runtime, background-service management, export UX, and Kimi Builders product
integration were implemented for this project. Provider-specific quota protocol
adaptations and the parser layer remain subject to the code-adaptation sections
above.

